      "Job Function Description": "A UX Writer crafts the words inside a product: the buttons, labels, messages, and instructions that guide people along. It sounds small, but the right words can make something feel simple, and the wrong ones can leave people lost. You think hard about tone and clarity, and you cut anything that confuses. It fits people who love language and care about making things easy to understand.",
      "Other Job Titles You May See in the World": "Content Designer, UX Content Strategist, Content Strategist, Product Writer",
      "You May Like This Job Function If...": "You may like this job function if you love language and believe the right handful of words can make something finally click. It suits people who care about clarity and tone, enjoy trimming the confusing bits, and like shaping how a product speaks to the people using it."
    },
