      "Job Function Description": "An Engineer builds the product, turning designs and ideas into working software. You write code, solve technical puzzles, and make sure things actually run the way they should. Much of the day is problem-solving: breaking a big challenge into small pieces and getting each one working. It fits people who like logic, enjoy building things, and feel real satisfaction when something they made finally works.",
      "Other Job Titles You May See in the World": "Software Engineer, Developer, Software Developer, Full Stack Engineer, Front-End or Back-End Engineer",
      "You May Like This Job Function If...": "You may like this job function if you like logic, enjoy building things, and feel a real spark when a tricky problem finally clicks into place. It suits people who like breaking big challenges into small pieces and seeing their work run in the real world."
    },
