      ],
      "Job Function Description": "A Product Owner decides what the team should build next and in what order. You take a long list of possible work and turn it into a clear, prioritized plan the team can act on. A lot of the job is saying this first, that later, and explaining why. It suits people who like making decisions, can balance many voices, and enjoy owning the details of getting a product delivered.",
      "Other Job Titles You May See in the World": "Backlog Owner, Technical Product Owner, Associate Product Manager, Product Lead",
      "You May Like This Job Function If...": "You may like this job function if you like making decisions and bringing order to a long list of possibilities. It fits people who can weigh many priorities, enjoy explaining the why behind the order of work, and like owning the details of getting things delivered."
    },
